3:/**
4: * Convert string[][] records into ordinary objects without mutating any input.
5: * options.header omitted, undefined, or true: consume the first record as names;
6: * an empty input or header-only input returns []. An array header supplies the
7: * names explicitly instead, consuming no records. Other header values throw
